  "ingredients": [
    "1 (8 ounce) chicken breast",
    "2 teaspoons olive oil",
    "garlic powder to taste",
    "salt to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat an air fryer to 360 degrees F (182 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mhTjH5Ml-T0V_CeIggLZYsw3ZbU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-283850-easy-air-fried-chicken-breast-VAT-step-01-faef3c5d11124d71bf731d51dd6fbbfd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283850/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush both sides of chicken breast with olive oil; season with garlic powder, salt, and pepper on one side. Place chicken breast, seasoned-side down, into the air fryer basket and sprinkle the other side with garlic powder, salt, and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/m9kzCgRkU087BPBpgCIRGTiFbVQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-283850-easy-air-fried-chicken-breast-VAT-step-02-06e9106d3a624a2fa97a962b3e71e771.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283850/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in the preheated air fryer for 9 minutes. Flip chicken and continue cooking until no longer pink in the center and the juices run clear, about 9 more minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/81fHw_PZmC4fOusSaD5ebh0bc3w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-283850-easy-air-fried-chicken-breast-VAT-step-03-1thermometer-8d898bc2f8e44df39b45fa4ddd8f3f46.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/283850/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer chicken breast to a plate and loosely cover with aluminum foil. Let rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N7D3sd3qxEAT7NxkxaiUE3W3Ugs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-283850-easy-air-fried-chicken-breast-VAT-step-04-1chickencovered-92aa6511741b478086b12d1d30961c5f.jpg"
